#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:3
msgid "Reloop Beatmix 4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:5
msgid ""
"The Reloop Beatmix 4 MK2 is a performance-oriented 4-channel pad controller "
"with integrated soundcard. It offers an ergonomically designed 4-channel "
"mixer layout, optimized for the club allowing you to work intuitively: "
"Dedicated equalizer and gain dials, high-quality line-faders, an extremely "
"smooth-running crossfader, 16 multi-colour drum pads, as well as two "
"extensive FX units are the foundation for your creativity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:9
msgid ""
"[Manufacturer’s product page](http://www.reloop.com/reloop-beatmix-4-mk2)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:10
msgid ""
"[Forum thread](https://mixxx.discourse.group/t/reloop-"
"beatmix-2-4-mapping/16049)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:14
msgid "Audio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:16
msgid ""
"This controller is a MIDI and audio class compliant device so it is "
"compatible as-is with Linux, MacOS and Windows. On windows, the manufacturer"
" ships an {term}`ASIO` low-latency driver that can be found on the "
"[Manufacturer’s product page](http://www.reloop.com/reloop-beatmix-4)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:19
msgid ""
"The {hwlabel}`MIC` input is hardware-mixed and is not digitized so Mixxx can"
" not have any control on the mic and you can not use ducking in Mixxx. The "
"{hwlabel}`MASTER` volume and {hwlabel}`PHONES` volume knobs directly control"
" hardware and don’t change Mixxx controls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:22
msgid "Mixer Section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:27
#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:86
#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:140
#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:187
msgid "Control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:28
#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:87
#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:188
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:29
msgid "{hwlabel}`MASTER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:30
msgid ""
"Controls the main volume to your main sound system. This controls the built "
"in sound card and has no effect on the main gain knob in Mixxx."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:31
msgid "{hwlabel}`PHONES`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:32
msgid ""
"Controls your headphones volume. This controls the built in sound card and "
"has no effect on the headphone gain knob in Mixxx."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:33
msgid "{hwlabel}`CUE MIX`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:34
msgid ""
"Mixes the headphones CUE signal between your selected channel and the main "
"output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:35
msgid "{hwlabel}`TRAX SELECT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:36
msgid ""
"Use the {ref}`Trax selector <reloop-beatmix-4-traxselector>` to navigate "
"through your song library."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:37
msgid "{hwlabel}`TRACK LOAD` (short press)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:38
msgid ""
"Load tracks on either channel. These buttons are lit when a track is loaded "
"into the associated deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:39
msgid "{hwlabel}`TRACK LOAD` (long press)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:40
msgid "Eject the selected deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:41
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT`{hwlabel}`TRACK LOAD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:42
msgid ""
"Enable and launch a track using your linefader ({hwlabel}`FADER-START`, "
"hardware function)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:43
#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:92
msgid "{hwlabel}`CUE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:44
msgid ""
"Pre-listen the selected channel in your headphones. This buttons lights-up "
"when activated"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:45
msgid "{hwlabel}`BACK`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:46
msgid ""
"Switch {ref}`Trax action <reloop-beatmix-4-traxselector>` between playlists "
"(sidebar), tracks and Preview Deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:47
msgid "{hwlabel}`SAMPLER VOLUME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:48
msgid "Controls the volume of all samplers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:49
msgid "{hwlabel}`LINE FADERS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:50
msgid "Controls your channel volume."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:51
msgid "{hwlabel}`CROSSFADER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:52
msgid "Enables you to fade between your decks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:53
msgid "{hwlabel}`GAIN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:54
msgid "Adjust the gain for each deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:55
msgid "{hwlabel}`EQ`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:56
msgid "Tweak the high, mid or low frequencies when mixing your track."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:57
msgid "{hwlabel}`DECK`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:58
msgid ""
"Press the deck button to swap between decks 1 & 3 on the left and 2 & 4 on "
"the right."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:62
msgid ""
"You can replace the fader cap of the {hwlabel}`SAMPLER VOLUME` fader with a "
"custom colored fader cap to make it visually stand out from the channel "
"volume faders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:66
msgid "Trax selector and Back button"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:68
msgid ""
"The trax selector let you navigate through your library (playlist and "
"tracks) as well as preview tracks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:70
msgid "The trax selector has three modes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:72
msgid "Track mode (default)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:73
msgid ""
"Turning the trax selector will select tracks (one by one), turning with "
"shift will select tracks faster (10 by 10). Pressing the {hwlabel}`Back` "
"button will switch to Playlist mode and pushing the trax selector will load "
"the selected track into the preview deck, start playing and switch to "
"Preview mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:75
msgid "Playlist mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:76
msgid ""
"Turning the trax selector will select sidebar item (one by one), turning "
"with shift will select sidebar item faster (10 by 10). Pressing the trax "
"selector will expand/collapse the selected sidebar item and pressing the "
"{hwlabel}`Back` button will return to Track mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:78
msgid "Preview mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:79
msgid ""
"Turning the trax selector let you navigate through the track loaded in the "
"PreviewDeck (faster with shift), pushing the trax selector will play/pause "
"the preview deck and pushing the {hwlabel}`back` button return to Track "
"mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:81
msgid "Transport Section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:88
msgid "{hwlabel}`PLAY/PAUSE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:89
msgid "Press to launch and pause your track."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:90
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`PLAY/PAUSE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:91
msgid "Reverses the direction of the track playing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:93
msgid ""
"Sets a temporary {term}`cue point`. It is set by pausing the track and "
"pressing the {hwlabel}`CUE` button. While the track is playing, press the "
"button to return to that point, where it will pause."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:94
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`CUE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:95
msgid "Takes you back to the start of your track."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:96
msgid "{hwlabel}`CUP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:97
msgid ""
"Takes you directly to your cue point and starts playback instantly. If no "
"cue point is set, it will jump to the beginning of the track."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:98
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`CUP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:99
msgid "Changes the pitch range, cycling through 8%, 10%, 12% and 16%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:100
msgid "{hwlabel}`SYNC`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:101
msgid ""
"Syncs the BPM and phase to that of the other track (if {term}`BPM` is "
"detected on both)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:102
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`SYNC`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:103
msgid "Turn on sync lock, keeping sync enabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:107
msgid "Jog wheel and pitch slider"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:109
msgid "Touch and move the jog wheel to scratch (either deck playing or not)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:111
msgid ""
"When playing, use the side of the wheel, without touching the metallic "
"platter, to temporarily bend the pitch (speed up/slow down playback). When "
"the deck is not playing, using the side of the wheel let you quick search "
"through your track."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:114
msgid ""
"Hold {hwlabel}`SHIFT` and turn the jog wheel to quick search through your "
"track. {hwlabel}`SHIFT` ignores touch sensitive platter so holding it and "
"turning jogwheel is the same as using the side of the jog wheel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:117
msgid ""
"When a deck is playing, jog led will turn around at 33.3 RPM. When track "
"time left is below 30 seconds, jog leds will blink slowly, and when track "
"time remaining is below 15 seconds, jog leds will blink quickly. These "
"delays can be changed by editing the two variables at the beginning of the "
"JavaScript file and eventually set to -1 to disable jog led blink."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:121
msgid "The pitch slider let you adjust pitch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:123
msgid ""
"{hwlabel}`PITCH +/-` buttons let you temporarily adjust the the speed one "
"step higher/lower. These buttons, when used with shift, let you "
"{ref}`control effects <reloop-beatmix-4-effects>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:129
msgid "Effects Section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:131
msgid ""
"The effect section let you control the first two EffectUnits. There are two "
"different effect modes mapped:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:134
msgid ""
"Multi Effect mode (the default), where you can load up to three effects in "
"each EffectUnit and control then with the super knob"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:135
msgid ""
"Single Effect mode, where you can load a single effect in the Effect Unit "
"and control the first 6 parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:141
msgid "Multi Effect mode"
msgstr ""

