#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:153
msgid "select effect 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:154
msgid "Effect parameter 4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:155
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`FX2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:156
msgid "select effect 2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:157
msgid "Effect parameter 5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:158
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`FX3`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:159
msgid "select effect 3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:160
msgid "Effect parameter 6"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:161
msgid "{hwlabel}`BEATS` (turn)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:162
msgid "SuperKnob"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:163
msgid "dry/wet knob"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:164
msgid "{hwlabel}`BEATS` (push)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:165
msgid "Toggle Effect Unit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:167
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`Beats` (turn)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:168
msgid "Dry/Wet knob"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:169
msgid "Select Effect Chain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:170
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`Beats` (push)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:171
msgid "Eject Effect Chain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:175
msgid ""
"You can choose which deck you want to apply EffectUnit 1 and 2 by pressing "
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`PITCHBEND -` / {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + "
"{hwlabel}`PITCHBEND +` on that deck (short press)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:177
msgid ""
"To switch from Single Effect mode to Multi Effect mode, hold down "
"{hwlabel}`SHIFT` and press {hwlabel}`PITCHBEND -` for more than a second to "
"switch to “Single Effect mode” or {hwlabel}`PITCHBEND +` for more than a "
"second to switch to “Multi Effect mode”. The corresponding led will blink "
"three times, indicating which mode you switched to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:180
msgid "Pad Section"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:182
msgid "Mode A - Cue points and Loops"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:189
msgid "Pads 1-4 (top row)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:190
msgid ""
"Press an unlit pad to set a new {term}`cue point`. If it is already set, "
"jump to this cue point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:191
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + Pads 1-4 (top row)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:192
msgid "Deletes cue points."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:193
msgid "Pads 5-8 (bottom row)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:194
msgid ""
"Press the pad to activate a loop. Loop length (in beats) is respectively 1, "
"2, 4 and 8 beats."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:195
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + Pads 5 (bottom row)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:196
msgid ""
"Sets a loop length. Push to define loop start, release to define loop end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:197
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + Pads 6 (bottom row)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:198
msgid "Shortens (half) the loop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:199
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + Pads 7 (bottom row)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:200
msgid "Lengthens (double) the loop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:201
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + Pads 8 (bottom row)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:202
msgid "Replays the loop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:205
msgid "Mode B - Samplers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:207
msgid ""
"Mode B let you control 8 samplers. Top row is for sampler 1-4 and bottom row"
" is for sampler 5-8, each sampler controlled by a pad button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:210
msgid ""
"Press an unlit pad to load the track selected in the library to that "
"sampler. Pads are red when the sampler is loaded but not playing and purple "
"when playing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:213
msgid ""
"Press a red pad to play the sample from its cue point. Press a purple pad to"
" jump back to the sample’s cue point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:216
msgid ""
"Press a purple pad with shift to stop a playing sample. Press a red pad with"
" shift to eject a sample."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:219
msgid "Split mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:221
msgid ""
"Split mode is activated by pressing mode A and mode B buttons "
"simultaneously. The two leds A and B are lit together. In this mode, to top "
"row is configured in mode A, and the bottom row if configured as the top row"
" of mode B."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_beatmix_4.md:224
msgid "So in this mode, you can control 4 cue points and 4 samplers."
msgstr ""
